config RGBLED_WIDGET_BATTERY_LEVEL_HIGH
    int "High battery level percentage"
    range 2 100
    default 80
    help
      At and above this level the battery shows BATTERY_RGB_HIGH. With
      BATTERY_GRADIENT it is where the gradient is fully that colour.

config RGBLED_WIDGET_BATTERY_LEVEL_LOW
    int "Low battery level percentage"
    range 1 99
    default 10
    help
      At and below this level the battery shows BATTERY_RGB_LOW, with and
      without BATTERY_GRADIENT. Must be below BATTERY_LEVEL_HIGH. BATTERY_PULSE starts here too,
      unless BATTERY_PULSE_LEVEL is set.

config RGBLED_WIDGET_BATTERY_LEVEL_CRITICAL
    int "Critical battery level percentage (0 = off)"
    default 0
    help
      One BATTERY_RGB_CRITICAL blink every time ZMK reports a new battery
      level at or below this. Off by default: BATTERY_PULSE warns of a low
      battery at a steady cadence instead.

